WEBVTT

00:07.738 --> 00:09.174
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.261 --> 00:10.695
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.782 --> 00:12.391
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.478 --> 00:14.217
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain!
孩子们：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.304 --> 00:17.478
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.564 --> 00:19.478
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.564 --> 00:21.564
Kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.651 --> 00:23.280
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.304 --> 00:25.304
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.391 --> 00:27.280
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.304 --> 00:29.391
kids:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
孩子们：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.478 --> 00:31.521
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.608 --> 00:33.174
kids: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
孩子们：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.261 --> 00:34.956
All:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.043 --> 00:37.391
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.478 --> 00:39.217
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.304 --> 00:40.695
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.782 --> 00:42.521
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.608 --> 00:45.174
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.261 --> 00:47.521
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:47.608 --> 00:49.174
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:52.000 --> 00:55.130
[relaxing beachy music]
[轻松的海滩音乐]

00:55.217 --> 01:00.912
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:01.000 --> 01:02.435
[upbeat jazz music]
[欢快的爵士乐]

01:02.521 --> 01:05.174
- And now back
to "The Kelpbed Kids."
- 现在回来了
到“海带孩子”。

01:05.261 --> 01:08.130
- "The Kelpbed Kids"
are hilarious.
- “海带孩子”
很搞笑。

01:08.217 --> 01:11.391
High four!
高四！

01:11.478 --> 01:14.391
[both laugh]
[两人都笑了]

01:14.478 --> 01:15.738
- [cackling]
- [咯咯笑]

01:15.825 --> 01:18.043
- Wonder why
it's in black and white.
- 想知道为什么
它是黑白的。

01:18.130 --> 01:22.782
- It's a "artistical" choice.
- 这是一个“艺术”的选择。

01:22.869 --> 01:25.521
- All right, Kelpbed Kids.
- 好吧，海带孩子们。

01:25.608 --> 01:27.608
Youse gonna spill the beans
你会泄露秘密

01:27.695 --> 01:30.956
about where you hide
all your candy
关于你藏身的地方
你所有的糖果

01:31.043 --> 01:33.869
in this here clubhouse or else!
在这个俱乐部会所或者其他地方！

01:33.956 --> 01:36.130
- Not to you, Ajax.
- 不是对你来说，阿贾克斯。

01:36.217 --> 01:39.435
- We'll never tell you
that it's in the cabinet.
- 我们永远不会告诉你
它在内阁里。

01:39.521 --> 01:41.304
[Kelpbed Kids groan]
[海带孩子们呻吟]

01:41.391 --> 01:43.651
Oh. Sorry, gang.
哦。对不起，帮派。

01:43.738 --> 01:45.261
[all grumble]
[大家抱怨]

01:45.348 --> 01:47.087
- Hey, Patrick,
don't the Kelpbed Kids
- 嘿，帕特里克，
海带孩子们不是吗

01:47.174 --> 01:48.738
kinda look like people we know?
看起来有点像我们认识的人？

01:48.825 --> 01:52.000
[glass shatters]
[玻璃碎裂]

01:52.087 --> 01:54.435
- I don't know
any people we know.
- 我不知道
我们认识的任何人。

01:54.521 --> 01:56.043
[gargles, spits]
[漱口、吐口水]

01:56.130 --> 01:59.261
Hmm. Eee!
唔。哎呀！

01:59.348 --> 02:02.391
- Oh-ho-ho-ho.
The cabinet, you say.
- 哦，嗬，嗬，嗬。
你说的是内阁。

02:02.478 --> 02:04.651
Aha!
啊哈！

02:04.738 --> 02:06.304
All: Hoops?
- [belches]
全体：篮球？
- [打嗝]

02:06.391 --> 02:08.651
Hi, Ajax.
嗨，阿贾克斯。

02:08.738 --> 02:10.782
- It's empty.
- 空了。

02:10.869 --> 02:13.261
I'm gonna give everyone here
我要给这里的每个人

02:13.348 --> 02:17.478
and their old man
a knuckle sandwich.
和他们的老人
指关节三明治

02:17.564 --> 02:20.348
- Oh boy! With cheese?
- 天啊！加奶酪？

02:20.435 --> 02:22.304
- With cheese.
- 配奶酪。

02:22.391 --> 02:25.651
- Oh, no you don't,
you dizzy ding dong.
- 哦，不，你不，
你头晕叮咚。

02:25.738 --> 02:26.391
Hwah!
哇！

02:26.478 --> 02:27.956
- Huh?
- 啊？

02:28.043 --> 02:30.521
[lively jazz music]
[活泼的爵士乐]

02:30.608 --> 02:33.608
Whuh?
呃？

02:33.695 --> 02:36.000
[laughs]
[笑]

02:38.869 --> 02:41.956
- Hey, what gives? Let me go.
- 嘿，什么给了？让我走吧。

02:42.043 --> 02:44.869
- You just got hooped.
- 你刚刚被套住了。

02:44.956 --> 02:46.478
All: Hoops, Hoops,
Hoops, Hoops!
所有： 篮圈，篮圈，
篮球，篮球！

02:46.564 --> 02:48.869
Both: Hoops, Hoops,
Hoops, Hoops!
两者：圈圈，圈圈，
篮球，篮球！

02:48.956 --> 02:50.217
- That settles it.
=> - 这就解决了。

02:50.304 --> 02:52.521
Hoops is
our favorite Kelpbed Kid.
篮球是
我们最喜欢的海藻小子。

02:52.608 --> 02:54.348
Let's get out
our official Hoops hoops
我们出去吧
我们的官方篮球圈

02:54.435 --> 02:56.695
that I bought on SeaBay.
我在SeaBay上买的。

02:56.782 --> 02:59.348
- Way ahead of ya, pally.
- 遥遥领先于你，伙计。

02:59.435 --> 03:04.130
- Gah!
- Hey, mine shrunk.
- 啊！
- 嘿，我的缩小了。

03:04.217 --> 03:08.043
- Oh, no, Patrick.
It's adjustable.
- 哦，不，帕特里克。
它是可调节的。

03:08.130 --> 03:10.695
Who says a hoop has to be round?
谁说箍一定是圆的？

03:10.782 --> 03:14.435
- Oh, yeah.
There's a relaxed-fit button.
- 哦，是的。
有一个宽松纽扣。

03:14.521 --> 03:16.043
Ah.
啊。

03:19.348 --> 03:23.174
- Someone wrote
all over my hula hoop.
- 有人写道
遍布我的呼啦圈。

03:23.261 --> 03:26.825
- Hey, there's an address
printed on here.
- 嘿，有一个地址
印在这里。

03:26.912 --> 03:29.478
And it's in Bikini Bottom.
它位于比基尼泳裤中。

03:29.564 --> 03:31.043
Do you think
it's where Hoops lives?
你认为
这是Hoops住的地方吗？

03:31.130 --> 03:34.304
Could we? Should we?
我们可以吗？我们应该吗？

03:34.391 --> 03:37.825
- Ring his doorbell
and run away?
- 按他的门铃
然后逃跑？

03:37.912 --> 03:39.869
- No.
- Toilet-paper his house?
- 不。
- 他家有卫生纸吗？

03:39.956 --> 03:41.564
- No.
- Switch out
- 不。
- 关掉

03:41.651 --> 03:44.000
his regular for decaf?
他常喝脱咖啡因咖啡？

03:44.087 --> 03:46.348
- No. We can meet him.
- 不，我们可以见到他。

03:46.435 --> 03:47.695
- Gotcha.
- 明白了。

03:47.782 --> 03:51.435
We can meet him,
then toilet-paper his house.
我们可以见到他，
然后用卫生纸给他的房子。

03:51.521 --> 03:53.956
He's gonna need it
after the coffee.
他会需要它
喝完咖啡后。

03:54.043 --> 03:56.000
[toilet flushing]
[冲厕所]

03:56.087 --> 03:58.478
- This is it...
where Hoops lives.
- 就是这个...
霍普斯住的地方。

03:58.564 --> 04:01.738
- It's a palace.
- 这是一座宫殿。

04:01.825 --> 04:04.738
[tense music]
[紧张的音乐]

04:04.825 --> 04:11.608
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

04:11.695 --> 04:14.782
- I'm too nervous to knock.
We don't really know him.
- 我太紧张了，不敢敲门。
我们并不真正了解他。

04:14.869 --> 04:17.000
What if he's one of
those suffering artist types
如果他是其中之一怎么办
那些受苦受难的艺术家类型

04:17.087 --> 04:18.564
who are into witchcraft?
谁沉迷于巫术？

04:18.651 --> 04:21.825
- Or what if he's a cannibal
and wants to eat us?
- 或者如果他是一个食人者怎么办
还想吃我们？

04:21.912 --> 04:24.608
- What if he's a cannibal
and doesn't want to eat us?
- 如果他是一个食人者怎么办
并不想吃掉我们？

04:24.695 --> 04:26.869
- We couldn't live
with the shame.
- 我们无法生活
带着羞耻。

04:26.956 --> 04:28.608
[doorknob clicking]
[门把手咔哒声]

04:28.695 --> 04:30.564
Oh, shh!
哦，嘘！

04:30.651 --> 04:31.956
Both: Run!
两人：跑！

04:32.043 --> 04:35.174
- [humming happily]
- [高兴地哼哼]

04:39.782 --> 04:41.478
- Old Man Walker?
- 老沃克？

04:41.564 --> 04:43.304
What's he doing in Hoops' house?
他在霍普斯家里做什么？

04:43.391 --> 04:45.130
Maybe we got the wrong house.
也许我们找错了房子。

04:45.217 --> 04:47.738
- Oh.
- Oh.
- 哦。
- 哦。

04:47.825 --> 04:50.304
He's sad that he got no mail.
- [chomps]
他很遗憾没有收到邮件。
- [咀嚼]

04:50.391 --> 04:54.435
That's 'cause I got it.
那是因为我明白了。

04:54.521 --> 04:57.695
- It's addressed to Hoops.
This is the right place.
- 是写给 Hoops 的。
这是正确的地方。

04:57.782 --> 04:59.478
- Whoa.
- 哇哦。

04:59.564 --> 05:02.564
The whole house is filled
with "Kelpbed Kid" stuff.
整个房子都被占满了
和“Kelpbed Kid”的东西。

05:02.651 --> 05:05.174
- It's just like being
in the show.
- 就像是
在节目中。

05:05.261 --> 05:08.130
Come on in.
- Don't mind if I do.
进来吧。
- 如果我这样做的话，请不要介意。

05:08.217 --> 05:10.174
- [grunts] What's happening?
- [咕哝]发生什么事了？

05:10.261 --> 05:13.000
[thunderous footsteps]
[雷鸣般的脚步声]

05:13.087 --> 05:15.825
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

05:15.912 --> 05:17.478
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:17.564 --> 05:19.000
- [snarls]
- [咆哮]

05:19.087 --> 05:22.217
- [gasps] Is that Hoops?
- [喘气] 那是篮球吗？

05:22.304 --> 05:24.391
- Uh, no.
It's Old Man Walker again.
- 呃，不。
又是老沃克。

05:24.478 --> 05:26.348
Remember? From the mailbox?
记住？从邮箱里发来的？

05:26.435 --> 05:28.348
- [retches] Oh, yeah.
- [干呕]哦，是的。

05:28.435 --> 05:33.869
- Hooligans! Swindlers!
Letter looters!
- 流氓！骗子！
信掠夺者！

05:33.956 --> 05:36.130
- Oh, we didn't mean any harm!
- 哦，我们没有任何恶意！

05:36.217 --> 05:38.043
We just wanted to meet Hoops.
我们只是想见见霍普斯。

05:38.130 --> 05:41.651
We're fans.
- We love Hoops!
我们是粉丝。
- 我们喜欢篮球！

05:41.738 --> 05:43.825
- Huh? Hoops?
- 啊？篮球？

05:43.912 --> 05:45.435
Why didn't you say so?
你为什么不这么说？

05:48.521 --> 05:49.564
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

05:49.651 --> 05:52.000
I'm Hoops!
我是霍普斯！

05:52.087 --> 05:54.651
[both laugh]
[两人都笑了]

05:54.738 --> 05:56.478
- Okay, old man.
- 好吧，老伙计。

05:56.564 --> 05:58.217
- Uh, I hate to break it to you,
- 呃，我不想打扰你，

05:58.304 --> 06:00.478
but Hoops is a little kid.
但霍普斯还是个小孩子。

06:00.564 --> 06:03.782
- Yup, I was Hoops
when I was a little kid,
- 是的，我是篮球
当我还是个小孩子的时候

06:03.869 --> 06:06.564
many years ago.
许多年前。

06:06.651 --> 06:10.391
- You're telling me
there have been many years?
- 你在告诉我
已经有很多年了？

06:10.478 --> 06:13.174
I don't believe it.
我不相信。

06:13.261 --> 06:16.695
- Yes, it was in the past.
- 是的，那是过去的事了。

06:16.782 --> 06:19.738
- I think you're trying
to "past" one over on us.
- 我想你正在努力
向我们“过去”一件事。

06:19.825 --> 06:21.130
- "Past" one over.
——《往事》一过。

06:21.217 --> 06:24.130
[laughing]
[笑]

06:24.217 --> 06:25.956
I don't get it.
我不明白。

06:26.043 --> 06:29.651
- Huh? What are you, a couple
of dizzy ding dongs?
- 啊？你们是什么啊，情侣
头晕的叮咚声？

06:29.738 --> 06:31.912
- Hey, he said
Hoops' catchphrase.
- 嘿，他说
霍普斯的口头禅。

06:32.000 --> 06:33.825
"Ya dizzy ding dongs."
“呀，头晕叮咚。”

06:33.912 --> 06:38.087
- Ya dizzy ding dongs.
- 呀，头晕叮咚。

06:38.174 --> 06:41.304
[both gasp]
[两人都喘气]

06:41.391 --> 06:43.956
- Patrick,
"Old Man" Walker is Hoops!
- 帕特里克，
“老头子”沃克是篮球人！

06:44.043 --> 06:48.000
He just kinda, sorta, decayed.
他只是有点，有点，腐烂了。

06:51.000 --> 06:53.000
- [gasps] Hoops!
- [喘气] 篮球！

06:53.087 --> 06:56.130
We love you!
- Oh!
我们爱你！
- 哦！

06:56.217 --> 06:59.435
You're breaking my bones.
你正在打断我的骨头。

06:59.521 --> 07:03.000
- Hey, he's got
a new catchphrase.
- 嘿，他有
一个新的流行语。

07:03.087 --> 07:04.521
[metallic clank]
[金属叮当声]

07:04.608 --> 07:07.130
- What was that?
- Was that my heart?
- 那是什么？
- 那是我的心吗？

07:07.217 --> 07:09.521
- Uh, no, it was outside.
- 呃，不，是在外面。

07:09.608 --> 07:11.956
- Huh? My heart's outside?
- 啊？我的心在外面吗？

07:12.043 --> 07:13.435
Oh, not again.
哦，不会了。

07:15.782 --> 07:17.608
- [cackles]
- [咯咯笑]

07:17.695 --> 07:19.261
- Aah!
- 啊啊！

07:19.348 --> 07:21.435
- Ow!
- Yum.
- 噢！
- 嗯。

07:23.564 --> 07:28.130
- Dagnabbit, it's that ruffian,
Ajax McGee.
- Dagnabbit，就是那个恶棍，
阿贾克斯·麦基.

07:28.217 --> 07:31.391
- Ajax? Isn't he the mean kid
in "The Kelpbed Kids" show?
- 阿贾克斯？他不是那个卑鄙的孩子吗
in "The Kelpbed Kids" show?

07:31.478 --> 07:33.087
- He was.
- 他是。

07:33.174 --> 07:34.782
Now he's the mean adult
现在他是个卑鄙的成年人了

07:34.869 --> 07:37.391
at Shady Shoals Retirement Home.
在谢迪肖尔斯退休之家。

07:37.478 --> 07:39.391
Oh!
哦！

07:39.478 --> 07:42.651
- That's what you get
for being a Kelpbed Kid,
- 这就是你得到的
作为一个海带孩子，

07:42.738 --> 07:45.564
Hoops the Poops.
圈住便便。

07:45.651 --> 07:48.391
[cackles]
[咯咯笑]

07:48.478 --> 07:52.738
- [gulps, laughs]
Hoops the Poops.
- [吞咽，大笑]
圈住便便。

07:52.825 --> 07:55.043
Classic.
经典的。

07:55.130 --> 08:00.261
Hey, I just had an idea.
Revenge.
嘿，我只是有一个主意。
复仇。

08:00.348 --> 08:05.000
Let's get back at Ajax,
like in one of your episodes.
Let's get back at Ajax,
就像你的其中一集一样。

08:05.087 --> 08:07.435
- Huh, episodes?
- 呃，剧集？

08:07.521 --> 08:10.738
Yeah, at my age,
I have a lot of episodes.
是的，在我这个年纪，
I have a lot of episodes.

08:10.825 --> 08:13.956
Who wants pudding?
- I do!
谁想要布丁？
- 我愿意！

08:14.043 --> 08:15.087
- Hold that pudding.
- 拿着那个布丁。

08:15.174 --> 08:17.087
We can build our own tank,
我们可以建造自己的坦克，

08:17.174 --> 08:20.217
and we'll gather material
"The Kelpbed Kids" way.
and we'll gather material
“海带孩子”方式。

08:20.304 --> 08:22.391
- Eh, the what bed
who... wait, what?
- 呃，什么床
谁……等等，什么？

08:22.478 --> 08:23.564
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

08:23.651 --> 08:27.261
both: Classic Hoops.
两者：经典篮球。

08:27.348 --> 08:30.217
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

08:30.304 --> 08:32.174
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:32.261 --> 08:34.478
- [moaning]
- [呻吟]

08:36.261 --> 08:39.261
- [humming] Huh?
- [哼哼] 嗯？

08:39.348 --> 08:42.217
[both laugh]
[两人都笑了]

08:46.261 --> 08:48.782
both: Ah!
两人：啊！

08:48.869 --> 08:50.174
[both groan]
[两人都呻吟]

08:50.261 --> 08:53.043
- Hmm?
- 唔？

08:55.000 --> 08:59.174
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

08:59.261 --> 09:02.304
[laughter]
[笑声]

09:02.391 --> 09:04.391
[bikers scream]
[骑自行车的人尖叫]

09:04.478 --> 09:07.304
[clicking, whirring]
[咔哒声，呼呼声]

09:12.348 --> 09:15.825
- We're coming for you,
Ajax McGee!
- 我们来找你了
阿贾克斯·麦基！

09:15.912 --> 09:20.912
- Say hello
to my Meanie Mangler!
- 打个招呼
致我的米妮·曼格勒！

09:21.000 --> 09:23.348
[triumphant music]
[胜利的音乐]

09:23.435 --> 09:29.261
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:29.348 --> 09:32.651
- Here we are, Hoops.
Shady Shoals.
- 我们到了，霍普斯。
阴暗浅滩。

09:32.738 --> 09:34.261
Now call out for Ajax.
现在呼叫阿贾克斯。

09:34.348 --> 09:36.695
- Eh? Huh? Who am I calling?
- 呃？啊？ Who am I calling?

09:36.782 --> 09:40.043
- Talk into this.
- Hello, operator?
- 谈谈这个。
- 你好，接线员？

09:40.130 --> 09:42.564
This is Barracuda 4117.
这是梭子鱼 4117。

09:42.651 --> 09:46.130
Is my prescription ready yet?
我的处方准备好了吗？

09:46.217 --> 09:48.956
- 23 Skiddoo.
- 23 斯基杜。

09:49.043 --> 09:51.956
Hey, where did you get
that pile of junk?
嘿，你从哪里得到的
那堆垃圾？

09:52.043 --> 09:56.174
Never mind, I don't care.
Have some eggs!
没关系，我不在乎。
吃点鸡蛋吧！

09:56.261 --> 09:58.912
- Whoa! Prepare cannon.
- 哇！准备大炮。

09:59.000 --> 10:00.608
Fire!
火！

10:02.695 --> 10:04.782
- Huh?
- 啊？

10:04.869 --> 10:07.695
- Uh, you loaded the cannon
with toast?
- 呃，你装上了大炮
配吐司？

10:07.782 --> 10:11.435
- I always have toast with eggs.
- 我总是吃鸡蛋吐司。

10:11.521 --> 10:13.130
- Deploying salt lick.
- 部署舔盐。

10:13.217 --> 10:19.435
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

10:21.391 --> 10:24.564
Engaging sea cow.
参与海牛。

10:24.651 --> 10:28.695
- [moos]
- [哞哞]

10:28.782 --> 10:31.348
- Eugh. Ooh. Ew. Ugh.
- 呃。哦。呃。啊。

10:31.435 --> 10:34.087
Your tongue is so rough!
你的舌头太粗糙了！

10:34.174 --> 10:37.043
- Huh?
- Hmm? [screams]
- 啊？
- 唔？ [尖叫声]

10:37.130 --> 10:38.651
- [snickers]
- [窃笑]

10:38.738 --> 10:41.651
[Klaxon blares]
- [yowls]
[喇叭声]
- [嚎叫]

10:45.738 --> 10:48.348
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

10:48.435 --> 10:51.956
- Whoa!
- 哇！

10:52.043 --> 10:56.348
Whoa, whoa! Aah!
Everything smells like toast!
哇哦！啊啊！
一切都闻起来像吐司！

10:56.435 --> 10:59.304
[all wailing]
[全体哀嚎]

11:04.564 --> 11:06.217
- Aah!
- 啊啊！

11:06.304 --> 11:08.435
[grunts]
- [groans]
[咕哝]
- [呻吟]

11:08.521 --> 11:11.304
[pinball sounds chiming]
[弹球声响起]

11:11.391 --> 11:13.695
[all grunting and screaming]
[所有的咕哝声和尖叫声]

11:13.782 --> 11:15.000
[laughter]
[笑声]

11:17.391 --> 11:19.651
[all groaning weakly]
[所有人都微弱地呻吟]

11:19.738 --> 11:21.174
[bright music]
[明亮的音乐]

11:21.261 --> 11:23.608
- Look, there goes Ajax.
- 看，阿贾克斯来了。

11:23.695 --> 11:27.391
- I'll get youse next time!
- 下次我给你买！

11:27.478 --> 11:32.087
- Say my name.
I'm Hoops the Poops.
- 说出我的名字。
我是胡普斯。

11:32.174 --> 11:34.043
- Classic.
- 经典的。

11:34.130 --> 11:37.435
Both: Best "Kelpbed Kids"
adventure ever!
两者：最佳“海带孩子”
永远的冒险！

11:37.521 --> 11:39.651
High four!
高四！

11:39.738 --> 11:42.174
[both laugh]
[两人都笑了]

11:42.261 --> 11:44.956
- Oops. Uh...
- Aah!
- 哎呀。呃...
- 啊啊！

11:45.043 --> 11:47.217
- Just call me Hoops the Oops.
- 就叫我“Hoops the Oops”吧。

11:47.304 --> 11:48.608
[laughs]
[笑]

11:52.000 --> 11:54.869
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

11:54.956 --> 11:59.304
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:59.391 --> 12:02.304
[all meeping insistently]
[所有人都坚持不懈地嘀咕着]

12:04.348 --> 12:06.651
- Okay, okay, one at a time.
- 好吧，好吧，一次一个。

12:06.738 --> 12:09.261
Krabby Patty!
- Krabby Patty!
蟹蟹帕蒂！
- 螃蟹帕蒂！

12:09.348 --> 12:10.912
- Krabby Patty, up!
- 克拉比帕蒂，起来！

12:11.000 --> 12:14.130
- Krabby Patty!
- Krabby Patty!
- 螃蟹帕蒂！
- 螃蟹帕蒂！

12:14.217 --> 12:16.478
- Krabby Patty, up!
- 克拉比帕蒂，起来！

12:16.564 --> 12:19.435
- Meep, meep.
- 米普，米普。

12:19.521 --> 12:23.651
- Oh, all this meeping is gonna
drive me cuckoo, Mr. Krabs.
- 哦，所有这些meeping都会
蟹老板，给我带来杜鹃鸟。

12:23.738 --> 12:26.217
- All these meeps
are paying your salary.
- 所有这些meeps
正在支付你的工资。

12:26.304 --> 12:29.391
Meeps are money.
- Krabby Patty!
米普就是钱。
- 螃蟹帕蒂！

12:29.478 --> 12:30.695
- Krabby Patty!
- 螃蟹帕蒂！

12:30.782 --> 12:33.000
- Krabby Patty, up!
- 克拉比帕蒂，起来！

12:33.087 --> 12:35.478
[munching]
[咀嚼]

12:35.564 --> 12:37.478
[loud gulping, belching]
[大声吞咽，打嗝]

12:37.564 --> 12:40.478
[meeping]
[嘀咕]

12:43.651 --> 12:47.304
- Wait, someone ordered
a Krabby Patty to-go.
- 等等，有人下令了
蟹肉饼外卖。

12:47.391 --> 12:49.478
Who ordered
a Krabby Patty to-go?
谁订购的
蟹黄饼外卖？

12:49.564 --> 12:52.043
Whoa!
哇！

12:52.130 --> 12:54.956
Wait, whose order is this?
等等，这是谁的命令？

12:55.043 --> 12:59.912
Whoa. Okay.
哇哦。好的。

13:00.000 --> 13:03.348
[meeping]
[嘀咕]

13:03.435 --> 13:06.478
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

13:09.956 --> 13:12.956
Pardon me, did someone order
a Krabby...
抱歉，有人下单吗
一个蟹蟹...

13:13.043 --> 13:15.521
[sighs oddly]
[奇怪地叹气]

13:15.608 --> 13:20.391
Oh, um, my bad.
I meant meep, meep.
哦，嗯，​​我的错。
我的意思是米普，米普。

13:20.478 --> 13:23.521
- Oh, meep.
- 哦，米普。

13:23.608 --> 13:25.435
Meep, meep.
[cash register dings]
米普，米普。
[收银机叮叮声]

13:25.521 --> 13:27.564
- Meep.
- 米普。

13:27.651 --> 13:28.651
[laughs]
[笑]

13:30.651 --> 13:33.564
[meeping]
[嘀咕]

13:33.651 --> 13:35.651
Oh boy, ice meep.
哦，孩子，冰米普。

13:35.738 --> 13:42.651
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

13:42.738 --> 13:45.261
[tires screeching]
[轮胎的尖叫声]

13:51.261 --> 13:53.304
[rhythmic meeping]
Yeah.
[有节奏的喵喵声]
是的。

13:53.391 --> 13:56.564
Real meep, daddy-o.
真是的，爸爸。

13:58.391 --> 14:01.304
[meeping excitedly]
[兴奋地嘀咕]

14:03.217 --> 14:08.738
Bouncy, bouncy!
Bouncy, bouncy, bouncy!
弹跳，弹跳！
弹跳，弹跳，弹跳！

14:08.825 --> 14:12.000
I love to meep.
[laughs]
我喜欢meep。
[笑]

14:13.782 --> 14:16.521
- Meep, meep!
- 米普，米普！

14:16.608 --> 14:19.130
- Meep!
- 米普！

14:19.217 --> 14:21.217
Meep, meep, meep.
Meep, meep, meep.
米普，米普，米普。
米普，米普，米普。

14:21.304 --> 14:22.478
[doorbell chimes]
Meep?
[门铃响]
米普？

14:22.564 --> 14:24.956
Meep, meep, meep.
米普，米普，米普。

14:25.043 --> 14:27.825
- Hey, SpongeBob.
- 嘿，海绵宝宝。

14:27.912 --> 14:31.825
These palms are ready to play
some serious patty-cake.
这些手掌已准备好玩耍
一些正宗的馅饼。

14:31.912 --> 14:33.130
- Meep.
- 米普。

14:33.217 --> 14:35.217
- And you can't play patty-cake
- 而且你不能玩小馅饼

14:35.304 --> 14:38.435
without cake.
- Meep!
没有蛋糕。
- 米普！

14:42.391 --> 14:44.498
- Patty-cake, patty-cake.
- Meep-meep-meep, meep-meep...
- 馅饼，馅饼。
- 喵喵喵，喵喵喵……

14:44.521 --> 14:48.478
- Baker's man, I'll eat
the cake as fast as I can.
- 面包师的人，我来吃
尽可能快地做蛋糕。

14:48.564 --> 14:51.651
Mama called the doctor,
and the doctor said,
妈妈打电话给医生，
医生说，

14:51.738 --> 14:55.825
"No more patty-cakes jumping
on the bed."
“不再有馅饼跳跃
在床上。”

14:55.912 --> 14:58.564
Meep, meep, meep.
Meep, meep, meep.
米普，米普，米普。
米普，米普，米普。

14:58.651 --> 15:01.608
- Meep, meep mah-meep,
meep, meep, meep, meep, meep.
- 米普，米普，玛米普，
米普，米普，米普，米普，米普。

15:01.695 --> 15:04.348
- Meep, meep, meep.
- Mailman!
- 米普，米普，米普。
- 邮递员！

15:04.435 --> 15:07.130
- Meep.
[both meeping]
- 米普。
[两人都嘀咕着]

15:07.217 --> 15:10.391
- Morning, SpongeBob.
Morning, Patrick.
- 早上好，海绵宝宝。
早上好，帕特里克。

15:10.478 --> 15:11.651
[Klaxon blares]
[喇叭声]

15:11.738 --> 15:13.869
[both meeping]
[两人都嘀咕着]

15:13.956 --> 15:17.217
No!
不！

15:17.304 --> 15:20.217
[all meeping]
[大家都在嘀咕]

15:23.478 --> 15:26.521
- It's about time, SpongeBob.
- 是时候了，海绵宝宝。

15:26.608 --> 15:29.043
LateBob is more like it.
LateBob 更喜欢它。

15:29.130 --> 15:32.869
Ha, LateBob.
[laughs, snorts]
哈，迟到的鲍勃。
[大笑，哼哼]

15:32.956 --> 15:34.521
- When you're done snorting,
- 当你吸完鼻涕后

15:34.608 --> 15:36.521
I'd like to order
a Krabby Patty.
我想订购
蟹肉饼。

15:36.608 --> 15:39.956
- Okay, hold on. [laughs]
- [growls]
- 好吧，等一下。 [笑]
- [咆哮]

15:40.043 --> 15:42.087
- One Krabby Patty, SpongeBob.
- 一只蟹蟹饼、海绵宝宝。

15:42.174 --> 15:44.304
- Meep, meep.
- Meep, meep.
- 米普，米普。
- 米普，米普。

15:44.391 --> 15:46.087
Meep, meep, meep. Meep.
米普，米普，米普。米普。

15:46.174 --> 15:48.261
Meep, meep, meep, meep,
meep, meep, meep, meep.
米普，米普，米普，米普，
米普，米普，米普，米普。

15:48.348 --> 15:50.651
Meep.
- [gulping] Meep.
米普。
- [吞咽]米普。

15:50.738 --> 15:53.261
- SpongeBob, stop that meeping.
- 海绵宝宝，别再发出喵喵声了。

15:53.348 --> 15:56.521
What do you think you are?
An anchovy?
你以为你是什么？
凤尾鱼？

15:56.608 --> 15:59.174
- Oof!
- I hear money meeps.
- 噢！
- 我听到钱的声音。

15:59.261 --> 16:01.000
Are the anchovies back?
凤尾鱼回来了吗？

16:01.087 --> 16:05.087
- It's SpongeBob.
- [meeping]
- 这是海绵宝宝。
- [嘀咕]

16:05.174 --> 16:07.087
- SpongeBob!
- 海绵宝宝！

16:07.174 --> 16:09.738
What in the barnacles
is going on here?
藤壶里有什么
这是怎么回事？

16:09.825 --> 16:13.130
- [squeals] [all meeping]
- [尖叫声] [全部发出喵喵声]

16:26.912 --> 16:28.912
- Oh, di-doo. Oh.
- 哦，迪杜。哦。

16:29.000 --> 16:29.999
[all meeping]
Huh?
[大家都在嘀咕]
啊？

16:32.912 --> 16:35.435
- [growls, barks]
- [咆哮，吠叫]

16:35.521 --> 16:39.261
- Step aside and let
my precious Fifi pass,
- 靠边让
我珍贵的菲菲通行证，

16:39.348 --> 16:42.478
or I will be offended.
否则我会被冒犯。

16:42.564 --> 16:44.608
Oh!
哦！

16:44.695 --> 16:46.478
Meep?
Both: Meep!
米普？
两人：喵！

16:46.564 --> 16:49.130
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

16:51.304 --> 16:53.564
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

16:53.651 --> 16:55.521
- Huh?
- 啊？

16:58.000 --> 17:00.391
It's a stamp-meep!
这是一张邮票！

17:00.478 --> 17:03.521
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

17:03.608 --> 17:06.608
Phew.
[gasps]
唷。
[喘气]

17:12.956 --> 17:14.869
Meep. Meep, meep, meep.
米普。米普，米普，米普。

17:17.608 --> 17:19.912
- Bob Gale Doppler,
with the big weather.
- 鲍勃·盖尔·多普勒，
随着大天气。

17:20.000 --> 17:23.348
And I'd like to report it's
sunny skies for Bikini Bottom.
我想报告的是
比基尼泳裤的天空晴朗。

17:23.435 --> 17:27.521
But not today, cause there's
a storm warning coming at ya.
但今天不行，因为有
风暴警告即将向您发出。

17:27.608 --> 17:30.651
We got a gust of faux-chovies
coming in from the southwest.
我们尝到了一股人造chovies的味道
从西南方向进来。

17:30.738 --> 17:33.564
Now with a closer look,
here's our man on the street,
现在仔细一看，
这是我们在街上的那个人，

17:33.651 --> 17:34.869
Rube Goldfish.
鲁布金鱼。

17:34.956 --> 17:36.521
- Thanks, Gale.
- 谢谢，盖尔。

17:36.608 --> 17:38.391
I'm here with the faux-chovies
我带着假chovies来了

17:38.478 --> 17:41.043
that are causing all
this meep-abaloo.
导致所有
这个meep-abaloo。

17:41.130 --> 17:42.912
Now I just have
to ask the question
现在我只有
提出问题

17:43.000 --> 17:45.043
everyone wants to know.
每个人都想知道。

17:45.130 --> 17:47.782
What in the world
does "meep" mean?
世界上有什么
"meep" 是什么意思？

17:47.869 --> 17:51.000
[all chanting meeps]
[所有人都在喊口号]

17:53.478 --> 17:55.695
Ameeping.
阿米普。

17:55.782 --> 17:57.478
- Haha, thanks Rube.
- 哈哈，谢谢鲁布。

17:57.564 --> 17:59.521
So if you don't wanna turn
into an anchovy today,
所以如果你不想转身
今天变成凤尾鱼，

17:59.608 --> 18:01.348
you're advised to stay indoors
建议您呆在室内

18:01.435 --> 18:05.043
until that faux-chovy
pressure system moves away.
直到那个假chovy
压力系统移开。

18:05.130 --> 18:06.435
Ha ha.
[all meeping]
哈哈。
[大家都在嘀咕]

18:06.521 --> 18:08.695
Huh? Whoa!
啊？哇！

18:08.782 --> 18:11.435
[struggling]
[挣扎]

18:11.521 --> 18:15.261
Ha ha, meep.
哈哈，米普。

18:15.348 --> 18:18.608
- Ah.
And now it's Squiddy time.
- 啊。
现在是鱿鱼时间。

18:18.695 --> 18:22.174
Hoo! Ha ha, mm.
呼！哈哈，嗯。

18:22.261 --> 18:25.087
[scatting]
[分散]

18:25.174 --> 18:27.521
When the customers fizzle,
当顾客不欢而散时，

18:27.608 --> 18:30.521
the octopus will sizzle.
章鱼会发出嘶嘶声。

18:30.608 --> 18:32.738
Ha, yeah.
哈，是的。

18:32.825 --> 18:34.825
[feet pattering]
[脚打颤]

18:34.912 --> 18:37.000
[faint meeping]
[微弱的喵喵声]

18:37.087 --> 18:39.564
[together] Meep, meep!
Dinner, dinner.
[合] 喵喵！
晚餐，晚餐。

18:39.651 --> 18:42.217
Meep, meep. Dinner, dinner.
- Whoa!
米普，米普。晚餐，晚餐。
- 哇！

18:44.348 --> 18:46.348
[screams]
[尖叫声]

18:49.217 --> 18:53.651
SpongeBob and Mr. Krabs
are faux-chovies?
海绵宝宝和蟹老板
是假chovies吗？

18:53.738 --> 18:56.087
- Meep, meep.
- 米普，米普。

19:02.521 --> 19:04.391
- Okay, okay. Slow down.
- 好吧，好吧。减速。

19:04.478 --> 19:06.043
One Krabby Patty,
one Krabby Patty,
一份蟹肉饼，
一份蟹肉饼，

19:06.130 --> 19:08.130
one Krabby Patty,
one Krabby Patty.
一份蟹肉饼，
一份蟹肉饼。

19:11.391 --> 19:14.651
- Meep.
[all meeping]
- 米普。
[大家都在嘀咕]

19:14.738 --> 19:17.608
- Whoever wants a Krabby Patty,
raise your hand.
- 谁想要蟹肉饼，
举起你的手。

19:17.695 --> 19:20.825
I can't hear your meeping
with these headphones on.
我听不到你的喵喵声
戴着这些耳机。

19:20.912 --> 19:22.782
Thank Neptune.
Aah!
感谢海王星。
啊啊！

19:24.564 --> 19:27.782
No!
不！

19:27.869 --> 19:30.304
No! Not my headphones!
不！不是我的耳机！

19:30.391 --> 19:35.391
The meeps.
I can hear the horrible meeps.
米普们。
我能听到可怕的米普声。

19:37.174 --> 19:39.130
All: Meep, meep, hungry.
全体：喵，喵，饿了。

19:41.912 --> 19:43.782
- More meeps?
- 更多米普？

19:45.608 --> 19:46.912
All: Meep.
全体：米普。

19:47.000 --> 19:50.261
All: Meep.
All: Meep.
全体：米普。
全体：米普。

19:50.348 --> 19:53.869
- [gasps] Anchovy rumble!
- [喘气]凤尾鱼隆隆声！

19:53.956 --> 19:56.825
[upbeat tense music]
[欢快紧张的音乐]

19:56.912 --> 19:58.782
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

19:58.869 --> 20:01.738
all: Meep.
All: Meep.
全体：米普。
全体：米普。

20:01.825 --> 20:03.782
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

20:03.869 --> 20:08.478
all: Meep. Argh!
全体：米普。啊！

20:08.564 --> 20:11.435
[all angrily meep]
[全都愤怒地喵]

20:13.956 --> 20:15.564
- Meep.
- Meep.
- 米普。
- 米普。

20:15.651 --> 20:18.348
- Meeeeep.
- 嗯嗯。

20:18.435 --> 20:22.478
- My bad. I meant meep, meep.
- 我的错。我的意思是米普，米普。

20:22.564 --> 20:26.043
- Oh, meep.
- 哦，米普。

20:27.521 --> 20:30.651
[sniffs]
[嗅嗅]

20:30.738 --> 20:34.738
- Meep, meep!
I thought that was you.
- 米普，米普！
我以为那就是你。

20:34.825 --> 20:37.695
- The whole world
has gone insane!
- 整个世界
已经疯了！

20:37.782 --> 20:40.738
[all meep happily]
[大家都开心]

20:40.825 --> 20:43.521
I can't take it anymore.
我再也受不了了。

20:43.608 --> 20:45.869
That is the last meep!
那是最后的meep！

20:45.956 --> 20:48.825
[distressed panting]
[心疼的喘气]

20:48.912 --> 20:50.825
[phone ringing]
[电话铃声]

20:50.912 --> 20:53.304
[bright Italian melody]
【明亮的意大利旋律】

20:53.391 --> 20:57.391
- Serba's World of Pizza.
What do you want?
- 塞尔维亚的披萨世界。
你想要什么？

20:57.478 --> 21:00.608
- I'd like an extra, extra,
extra large pizza
- 我想要一个额外的，额外的，
超大披萨

21:00.695 --> 21:03.521
sent to the Krusty Krab
as soon as possible.
发送至蟹堡王
尽快。

21:03.608 --> 21:07.000
- Hey, you want-a a pizza
as soon-a as possible,
- 嘿，你想要一个披萨
尽快，

21:07.087 --> 21:10.391
you got it, Calimaro.
你明白了，卡利马罗。

21:10.478 --> 21:12.174
- Aah! Ha.
- 啊啊！哈。

21:12.261 --> 21:15.608
Nobody's turning me
into a faux-chovy.
没人让我转
变成假chovy。

21:15.695 --> 21:17.087
[laughs]
[笑]

21:20.174 --> 21:23.564
[meeping]
- Pizza delivery.
[嘀咕]
- 披萨外送。

21:23.651 --> 21:27.174
All: Huh?
全体：啊？

21:27.261 --> 21:29.869
Both: Pizza?
[all meeping]
两人：披萨？
[大家都在嘀咕]

21:36.478 --> 21:39.695
[all inhale deeply]
all: Mmm.
[所有人深吸一口气]
全体：嗯。

21:39.782 --> 21:42.608
- Mmm, that smells good.
- 嗯，闻起来很香。

21:42.695 --> 21:43.738
[both laugh]
[两人都笑了]

21:43.825 --> 21:45.000
both: Huh?
两人：啊？

21:45.087 --> 21:48.000
All: Oh!
- Phew.
全体：哦！
- 唷。

21:48.087 --> 21:51.217
I thought we'd never snap out
of that faux-chovy thing.
我以为我们永远不会分手
那个假chovy的东西。

21:51.304 --> 21:52.738
- Sorry, Mr. Krabs.
- 对不起，蟹老板。

21:52.825 --> 21:54.912
I didn't realize how easy it is
to get swept up
我没有意识到这有多容易
被卷走

21:55.000 --> 21:56.912
into a meep mentality.
进入一种meep心态。

21:57.000 --> 21:59.782
- It's not your fault, boy-o.
- 这不是你的错，小伙子。

21:59.869 --> 22:03.738
We're just lucky that pizza is
the anchovies' natural enemy.
我们很幸运，披萨是
凤尾鱼的天敌。

22:03.825 --> 22:10.217
- Yeah, whoever ordered
that pie saved our lives.
- 是的，无论是谁订购的
那块馅饼救了我们的命。

22:10.304 --> 22:12.391
- And we shouldn't let it go
to waste.
- 我们不应该放手
浪费。

22:12.478 --> 22:16.130
It's still hot.
- Oh-ho-ho!
天气还很热。
- 哦嗬嗬！

22:16.217 --> 22:18.478
[grunts] Gah!
[咕噜声] 啊！

22:20.956 --> 22:23.521
What? No anchovies?
什么？没有凤尾鱼吗？

22:23.608 --> 22:26.782
- All that meeping
made me hungry too.
- 所有那些喵喵叫声
也让我饿了。

22:26.869 --> 22:30.825
Mr. Squidward, we need
some paper plates out here.
章鱼哥先生，我们需要
这里有一些纸盘。

22:30.912 --> 22:33.348
- Squidward? Uh, are you here?
- 章鱼哥？呃，你在吗？

22:33.435 --> 22:35.782
- Now just where is
that lazy bum
- 现在就在哪里
那个懒惰的流浪汉

22:35.869 --> 22:37.738
while all this is going on?
当这一切发生的时候？

22:37.825 --> 22:40.435
[all meeping]
[大家都在嘀咕]

22:45.217 --> 22:48.261
- Meep.
- 米普。

22:49.738 --> 22:52.564
[light music]
[轻音乐]

22:52.651 --> 22:59.217
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

♪ ♪